decisions.new:
Praise God from down here on earth too — you sea monsters and ocean deeps;
fire and hail, snow and ice, hurricanes that take His orders;
mountains and all hills, apple orchards and cedar forests;
wild animals and herds of cattle, snakes and birds in flight;
kings of the earth and every nation, leaders and all you big shots;
strong young men and women in their prime, and yeah — grandpas and little kids too.
